CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication

Unless a file or upstream source says otherwise, project-created metadata,
manifests, scripts, notes, newly prepared TeX, and translation draft material
in this repository are dedicated under CC0 1.0 Universal, to the extent
possible under law.

The CC0 1.0 Universal legal text is available at:

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

Source scans, public-domain source texts, and imported upstream projects retain
their own public-domain status, provenance, author credit, and license context.
This repository is a working mirror of archival material and should not be read
as removing attribution, scholarly provenance, or upstream license notices.
